---
/**
 * The cassette spine: the site's mark, after the lerpette cards. Five bands of the
 * 90min videocassette label, widest outside, leaning at the italic It's 14 degrees.
 * See docs/brand/identity.md.
 *
 * It places itself, absolutely, in the nearest positioned ancestor: at --spine-at of a
 * reference box's width, --spine-share of that width wide, from --spine-top to
 * --spine-bottom. The reference box is the bordered panel the spine belongs to, so the
 * header's and the footer's line up, and both keep their proportions on any screen.
 * A host whose own box is not that panel says how much wider the panel is, with
 * --spine-box and --spine-inset (see .lerpette-player__bar).
 *
 * Decoration only, so it is hidden from assistive technology.
 */
---

<span class="brand-spine" aria-hidden="true"></span>
